{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bonfire Barrage</strong> is a rogue-like arena shoot 'em up with dynamic movement and upgrades that evolve. Protect the adventurer as they sleep, battling nightmarish creatures that emerge from the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709410/extras/Combat_05.gif?t=1747167470\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Bullet-Hell Combat</strong>: Engage in fast-paced, run-and-gun action as arena platforms shift and change, keeping you on your toes in every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709410/extras/Movement_02.gif?t=1747167470\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrades &amp; Evolution</strong>: Choose from a variety of upgrades during each run, with each one evolving into a more powerful form as you specialize. Choose your upgrades wisely to optimize your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709410/extras/Upgrades_03.gif?t=1747167470\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Grinding</strong>: Each death resets the game entirely, offering a fresh start with no meta-progression. All tools are available from the beginning\u2014no grinding required\u2014creating a hop-in, hop-out experience for players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo Includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Upgrade Evolutions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Flame Pact System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Bosses</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709410?t=1747167470","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709410?t=1747167470","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709410/9722fbbf23b58716b4a3d853f9e504dee05ec80e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747167470","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709410/9722fbbf23b58716b4a3d853f9e504dee05ec80e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747167470","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bonfire Barrage</strong> is a rogue-like arena shoot 'em up with dynamic movement and upgrades that evolve. Protect the adventurer as they sleep, battling nightmarish creatures that emerge from the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709410/extras/Combat_05.gif?t=1747167470\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Bullet-Hell Combat</strong>: Engage in fast-paced, run-and-gun action as arena platforms shift and change, keeping you on your toes in every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709410/extras/Movement_02.gif?t=1747167470\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrades &amp; Evolution</strong>: Choose from a variety of upgrades during each run, with each one evolving into a more powerful form as you specialize. Choose your upgrades wisely to optimize your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709410/extras/Upgrades_03.gif?t=1747167470\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Grinding</strong>: Each death resets the game entirely, offering a fresh start with no meta-progression. All tools are available from the beginning\u2